sabreak
=======

This package is a derivative work of `linebreak` (UAX #14 line breaking, MIT),
https://github.com/foliojs/linebreak

Upstream source is vendored unmodified at commit
  dc9603e8e58ce0e6d431cc5087ffb98132cc6a07
The exact files and their SHA-256 digests are recorded in
  test/fixtures/upstream-hashes.json
and re-verified by `test/package.test.js` on every test run.

Upstream licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2014-present Devon Govett.
The full licence text is in LICENSE; the upstream copyright notice is retained there.

Files added by this project
  src/sabreak.js                      dictionary analysis layer for SA-class scripts
  bin/sabreak.js                      command line inspector
  test/sabreak.test.js                behavioural, equivalence and oracle tests
  test/package.test.js                packaging, attribution and version-floor tests
  test/fixtures/browser-oracle.json   line-break positions recorded from a real browser
  test/fixtures/upstream-hashes.json  provenance pin for the vendored upstream files
  scripts/record-oracle.mjs           regenerates the browser oracle (needs a browser)

One upstream file was changed, and only its import specifier
  test/index.js       `from 'linebreak'` -> `from 'sabreak'`
                      (self-reference after the rename; every test case is untouched)

